            <param name="bdr_color_adv" value="#FF95918C" />
          </paramlist><![CDATA[Voltage Controller for DQ Frame
Built by Rick Wallace Kenyon; July 2020

Simply, dual DQ PI controller with feedforward and decoupling. Intended to operate with non-perunitized values.

Note that the assumed capacitance values are in microfarad!

]]></Sticky>
