            <param name="bdr_color_adv" value="#FF95918C" />
          </paramlist><![CDATA[Grid Forming Inverter
Built by Rick Wallace Kenyon; 2020


Dynamic model and subsystems were developed and installed by Wallace Kenyon, based on various academic resources. See paper 'Introducing Open-Source PSCAD Grid-Following and Grid-Forming Inverter Models' for mathematical formulation.

Reference:
@inproceedings{Kenyon2021PSCADmodels,
  title={Open-Source PSCAD Grid-Following and Grid-Forming (Zero-Inertia Capable) Inverters},
  author={Kenyon, R.~W. and Sajadi, A. and Hoke, A. and Hodge B.~M},
  booktitle={2021 IEEE Power and Energy Society General Meeting},
  pages={1--5},
  year={2021},
  organization={IEEE}
}]]></Sticky>
